    "collapsible_content_DRt4B7": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_Ejx8gY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Seamless / Undetectable",
            "row_content": "<p>With a wide variety of skin tones and a focus on smooth, seamless design, Honey Cloudz inserts blend effortlessly with your swimwear. They offer a comfortable fit without visible lines or bulges, ensuring a sleek appearance under any swimsuit. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rpw3jc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Non-Slip Grip",
            "row_content": "<p>Our swimsuit inserts are designed to stay in place, whether lounging by the pool or engaging in active water sports.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gTr48k": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Water-Safe and Chlorine-Resistant",
            "row_content": "<p>Made from durable, chlorine-resistant materials, our inserts are water-safe.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EWQ3hD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Full Nipple Coverage",
            "row_content": "<p>Each insert provides full nipple coverage, giving you peace of mind and ensuring you feel secure and confident in your swimwear.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JC6GwG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Versatile Use",
            "row_content": "<p>Whether you’re looking for nipple coverage, cleavage enhancement or to balance breast asymmetry, our range of inserts offers options - we’ve got you and your nips covered!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TqVUPm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Customizable Fit",
            "row_content": "<p>Honey Cloudz inserts cater to various skin tones and bra sizes, allowing you to find the perfect match for your swimwear. Our swimsuit inserts are designed to fit comfortably and stay in place, whether worn in built-in pockets or directly against the skin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_niYWgm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Enhanced Lift and Shape",
            "row_content": "<p>Our <strong>Push-Up Ovals</strong> and <strong>Push-Up Triangle Inserts</strong> provide natural lift and a fuller shape, helping to enhance your cleavage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
