    "image_with_text_UCxfxL": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_9hY6b8": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Swimsuit Inserts Inspired by Expertise",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_kzJ66L": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With 15 years in the swimwear industry, Angela Kornas was all too familiar with the shortcomings of traditional swimsuit inserts. Her experience, ranging from designing supportive swimwear to developing high-performance Olympic racing suits, highlighted a persistent issue: removable bra inserts were consistently low in quality. </p><p>Frustrated by decades of lack of innovation, Angela channeled her expertise into creating <strong>Honey Cloudz</strong>, aiming to deliver swimwear inserts that combine superior functionality with a comfortable, sleek fit. Her dedication has transformed swimsuit inserts into a game-changer for every woman’s swimwear experience.</p><p></p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        },
        "button_CkTFBn": {
