    "collapsible_content_gM7cWy": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_eWKHXj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I insert the Honey Cloudz bra inserts into my swimsuit?",
            "row_content": "<p>Inserting Honey Cloudz bra inserts into your swimsuit is easy! Simply slide the inserts into the built-in pockets of your swimsuit top. If your swimsuit doesn’t have pockets, no worries—our inserts are non-slip and can be worn directly against your skin for a secure fit. Make sure to position them as desired for the best shape and coverage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_B8ADGx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are Honey Cloudz inserts really water-safe?",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! All Honey Cloudz inserts are designed to be water-safe, meaning they’re perfect for swimming, lounging by the pool, or any water activity. Made from chlorine-resistant materials, these inserts won’t absorb water, ensuring they stay lightweight and in place, giving you full nipple coverage and a smooth shape even when wet.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hNbeGU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will the inserts be visible through my swimsuit?",
            "row_content": "<p>Not at all! Honey Cloudz inserts are designed with a seamless finish to ensure they remain undetectable under your swimsuit. They also come in various skin tones to blend in naturally, providing a comfortable, smooth appearance without any visible lines. You can confidently enjoy your swimwear knowing your inserts are completely discreet.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HkrYEK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I lift sagging breasts in a swimsuit?",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>T</strong>o lift sagging breasts in a swimsuit, try using our Push-Up Ovals or Push-Up Triangle Inserts. These <strong>swimsuit bra inserts</strong> provide a natural boost and enhanced lift, creating a fuller, more youthful silhouette. They are designed to fit seamlessly into your swimsuit and offer the support you need to feel confident and comfortable, whether you’re lounging by the pool or enjoying a swim.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UUh8wL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you add bra support to a swimsuit?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you can definitely add bra support to a swimsuit with Honey Cloudz inserts! Our <strong>swimsuit bra inserts</strong> are perfect for enhancing support and shaping. Options like our <strong>Push-Up Ovals</strong> and <strong>Triangle Push Up Inserts</strong> provide additional lift and structure, giving your swimsuit a more supportive fit without compromising comfort. Simply insert them into the built-in pockets of your swimsuit or wear them directly against your skin for a secure fit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
